## 7. File Structure

### 7.1 Directory Layout

```
Dogfight2/
├── index.html                    # Main game file (~10,000+ lines)
├── dogfight.html                 # Alternative version
├── package.json                  # Node.js config (Playwright)
├── package-lock.json            # Dependency lock
├── *.bat                         # Windows batch scripts
├── *.js                          # Test/diagnostic scripts
│
├── images/                       # Aircraft sprites
│   ├── *.png                     # WW1 aircraft images
│   ├── *.svg                     # WW2 aircraft images
