## 10. Recommendations

### 10.1 High Priority

#### 1. Refactor Code Structure
**Problem:** Monolithic 10,000+ line file is hard to maintain

**Solution:**
- Split into separate files:
  - `index.html` (structure only)
  - `styles.css` (all CSS)
  - `game.js` (main game logic)
  - `aircraft.js` (Aircraft class)
  - `terrain.js` (Terrain classes)
  - `combat.js` (combat system)
  - `ui.js` (UI functions)
  - `data.js` (aircraft database, missions)
- Use ES6 modules
- Add build process (webpack/vite)

**Benefits:**
- Easier navigation
- Better maintainability
- Enables code splitting
- Better IDE support

#### 2. Mission Editor UI
**Problem:** Must edit code to create missions

**Solution:**
- Visual editor with drag-and-drop
- Aircraft placement tool
- Objective editor
- Save/load custom scenarios
- JSON export/import

**Benefits:**
- User-generated content
- Easier mission creation
- Better user experience

#### 3. Save/Load System
**Problem:** No game state persistence

**Solution:**
- Save game state to LocalStorage
- Save campaign progress
